- Container mp4; video H.264, 1920x1080, 25 fps (r_frame_rate 25/1), 1500 frames, yuv420p, constant bitrate 24 Mbit/s (average ~24,000 kb/s; max-min within HRD CBR; file ~180 MB, +-3%).
- Audio AAC, 2 channels, 48000 Hz; duration 60.000 s (+-0.04 s), audio and video both full length.
